<div style="min-height:300px;">
    <h1 align="center">筑梦启航 “绿色通道”助力新生无忧入学</h1>
    <div align="center" style="line-height:60px;color:#aaa;">时间：2025-09-08&nbsp;&nbsp;阅读次数：<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1370093333, 12884)</script>&nbsp;</div>
    <div id="vsb_content" style="line-height:24px;"><div class="v_news_content">
<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: 等线 Light;  --docx-minorhansi-font: 等线;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #0E2841;  --docx-lt2-color: #E8E8E8;  --docx-accent1-color: #156082;  --docx-accent2-color: #E97132;  --docx-accent3-color: #196B24;  --docx-accent4-color: #0F9ED5;  --docx-accent5-color: #A02B93;  --docx-accent6-color: #4EA72E;  --docx-hlink-color: #467886;  --docx-folhlink-color: #96607D;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: Times New Roman;}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}.docx table, table.docx_3 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}p.docx_2 {  margin-top: 0.00pt;  margin-bottom: 0.00pt;  margin-left: 0.00pt;  margin-right: 0.00pt;  text-align: left;}p.docx_2 span {  min-height: 12.00pt;  font-size: 12.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}span.docx_5 {  font-weight: bold;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">8月23日至24日，2025级新生怀揣</span><span lang="en-US" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">梦想</span><span style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">踏入西电校园，开启</span><span lang="en-US" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">大学的</span><span style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">新篇程。为确保每一位家庭经济困难学生能够顺利入学</span><span lang="null" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">、</span><span lang="en-US" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">安心就学</span><span style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，学校继续开通“绿色通道”，</span><span lang="en-US" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">通过</span><span style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">“线上</span><span lang="en-US" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">前置</span><span style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">办理+线下暖心服务”双轨模式，助力</span><span lang="en-US" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">907</span><span style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">名家庭经济困难新生</span><span lang="en-US" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">顺利报到、开启</span><span style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">崭新校园生活。</span><br></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">暖心启程</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">畅</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">通入学路</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">报到现场</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">设置新生接待一站式服务点和新生“绿色通道”办理点，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">图文并茂的资助政策展板与学生资助宣传大使的</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">耐心</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">讲解</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">使暖心的资助政策及时传达到每一位新生心中，让新生</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">感受“入学即安心”。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">校领导</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">来到新生“绿色通道”办理现场</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，与新生亲切交谈，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">关心问候学生家长，并为学生送上</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">“爱心大礼包”，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">告诉</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">他们</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">遇到困难及时和学校说，学校会保障好学生在校期间的学习和生活，让大家顺利成长成才；勉励他们</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">要珍惜</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">大学时光，踏实努力学习，成长为有用之才。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 322.85pt; height: 181.55pt;"><img src="/__local/2/5B/52/8C97C500CB8378A586A09AC3374_1607D071_3F12A.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/25B528C97C500CB8378A586A09AC3374/1607D071/3F12A" vheight=" 181.55pt" vwidth=" 322.85pt" orisrc="/__local/C/66/EB/AEC6ADA0B7F8B2835D231620BA7_93C721E2_DCE92.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 322.85pt; height: 181.55pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">精准</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">前置 政策</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">早</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">知晓</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">新生报到</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">前，学校的资助工作</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">就已提前展开</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">。</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">暑期</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">资助</span><span id="_GoBack"></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">热线</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">持续开通不断线</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">《</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">资助政策简介》和《助学贷款申请指南》</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">随录取通知书</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">传达给全体新生</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">资助政策宣讲嵌入</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">“新生前置教育”课程</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">通过“西电学生奖助”微信公众号持续推出“资助政策解答”专栏，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">并及时回应学生关切，让资助内化于心</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">结合教育部</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">下发</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">特殊</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">类型</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学生数据与</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学校</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">迎新采集数据库</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">信息</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，学校开展</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">家庭经济困难生</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">精准摸排，为特殊困难类型、因灾致困等学生定制</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学习用品、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">生活用品等</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">共同组成“爱心大礼包”，体现关心关爱，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">全力保障同学们安心入住、</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">顺利</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">启程。</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">后续，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学校将</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">启动</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">新生入学教育资助项目，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">及时填补新生入学到相关补贴发放期间的空窗期，尽力减轻</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">入学后的</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学习和</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">生活压力。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 377.85pt; height: 125.95pt;"><img src="/__local/9/A7/67/7C1116378DEF513A94D483EE03F_A28DF324_2BFEF.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/9A7677C1116378DEF513A94D483EE03F/A28DF324/2BFEF" vheight=" 125.95pt" vwidth=" 377.85pt" orisrc="/__local/0/F4/C5/47FD5CD84D277687B266F1FF7BF_457126AE_AA687.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 377.85pt; height: 125.95pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">助学筑梦 护航新征程</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">开学后，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学校</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学生资助管理中心将持续推进“FAST”</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">未来适应和成功能力培训</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">发展型资助计划，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">通过开展“筑梦活动”引导新生思考规划、建立目标、规划路径，聚焦学生成长发展需求，利用</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">信息化</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">、</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">智能化手段推动家困生动态</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">识别</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">、</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">过程评价、赋能成长</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">扎实开展一系列发展型资助育人活动</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，构建“经济解困—能力提升—价值引领”的全链条服务体系</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">激发学生自我发展意识，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">用实际行动诠释“</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">努力让每个学生在西电都有人生出彩的机会</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">”</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">守护每一个梦想</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">。</span></p></article></section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
